### Connector Extension Test Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:7071/runtime/webhooks/connector

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/runtime/webhooks/connector

### =============================================================================
### OnNewEmail - Office 365 email trigger via Connector Namespace
### =============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}?functionName=OnNewEmail
Content-Type: application/json
x-ms-trigger-name: email-newemail-trigger
x-ms-gateway-resource-name: my-connector-namespace

{
  "body": {
    "value": [{
      "subject": "URGENT: Action Required",
      "from": "john@contoso.com"
    }]
  }
}
